      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As a further addendum to this, it actually doesn't seem like any \"recording\" happens at all. It just forces the root position transform of all affected bones. Even attempting a \"tongue\" work-around where the Phys Bones script only turns on at the moment the tongue is fully stuck out, the Phys Bones script still snaps the tongue bones back to their respective default transforms. Notably, this is NOT observed on the Unity Editor side, only once in-game.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
