      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "This issue was never internally tracked, however it was fixed in a release in mid 2022.  I've ran through some tests but am unable to reproduce anything at this time.  If anyone continues experiences this or a similar in the live client please open a new bug report with steps to reproduce.",
